    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"perhaps that is exactly what you need to do\"... that's a heavy thing to say. i don't even know if i'm being dramatic or if i'm just seeing the truth. everything i do feels like a performance. if i actually stopped performing, if i just leaned into that feeling of wanting to end it... would that be the only thing that actually feels real? like, is there something profound in just giving in to it?",
